comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T11:29:24.575Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for dist artifact fast version fast-json-patch and contract snapshot stale runtime compatibility found no matching active implementation. Historical items cover prior artifact and snapshot families but not this exact PR regression,so this item records the exact-head CI lineage."
  "2026-08-08T11:39:49.666Z","harness:codex","Verification: copied dist plus package.json into a temporary directory with no node_modules and node dist/cli.js --version returned 2026.8.7. pnpm contracts:check passes after regenerating tests/fixtures/contracts/full.json. The full repository run passes 453 files / 7,049 tests at exact 50,251/50,251 statements, 36,654/36,654 branches, 10,318/10,318 functions, and 48,655/48,655 lines; full lint/static quality passes after routing the import through the focused SDK seam."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T11:39:49.192Z","harness:codex","Dependency-free startup paths must be evaluated over the transitive static import graph, not just the apparent entry module; a type-safe barrel can still pull runtime-only packages before a fast-path early return."
